# ═══ Draft knowledge entry — hoedown 3.0.7 纯 Makefile 库工具链标志传递 ═══
# Timestamp: 2026-09-07
# Software: hoedown 3.0.7
# Gate: task hoedown-3.0.7-r01-bootstrap-and-adapt-pc2-33（配方 build() 设计）
# Status: DRAFT — needs human/AI review to promote to E-entry
#
